  "description": "spike #32 即弃最小双 half 包：验证 dsh browser half 全链路（dsh.client 装载 → settings.plugin.item 渲染 → settings 落盘读回）。非正式功能。",
  "private": true,
  "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
